{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p003844","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p003844"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p003844","label":"齊景公（伍胥列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"齊景公","mention_ids":["c-shiji-066-wu:m017-0009"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m017-0009","chapter_id":"c-shiji-066-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p017","quote":"齊景公"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m017-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"齊景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003844","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p017","chapter_id":"c-shiji-066-wu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji066-037","person_id":"cbr-p003844","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-066-wu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["齊景公"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p017","quote":"其後五年，而吳王聞齊景公死而大臣爭寵，新君弱，乃興師北伐齊。伍子胥諫曰：「句踐食不重味，弔死問疾，且欲有所用之也。此人不死，必為吳患。今吳之有越，猶人之有腹心疾也。而王不先越而乃務齊，不亦謬乎！」吳王不聽，伐齊，大敗齊師於艾陵，遂威鄒魯之君以歸。益疏子胥之謀。"}],"rationale":"依本篇明示姓名及局部敘事暫接異稱：公子光自立為闔廬、軫立為昭王、勝號白公；王稱隨敘事主體分段。王子綦佯充王不接昭王，與後文司馬子綦暫分候選但不斷言異人。悼公與陽生按本文分存，矛盾待版本覆核；鮑氏不強接鮑牧。未名父子只按本段明示保存，不補姓名。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p017","text":"其後五年，而吳王聞齊景公死而大臣爭寵，新君弱，乃興師北伐齊。伍子胥諫曰：「句踐食不重味，弔死問疾，且欲有所用之也。此人不死，必為吳患。今吳之有越，猶人之有腹心疾也。而王不先越而乃務齊，不亦謬乎！」吳王不聽，伐齊，大敗齊師於艾陵，遂威鄒魯之君以歸。益疏子胥之謀。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m017-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003840","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m017-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"齊景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003844","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m017-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"大臣","kind":